/-- The incoming renormalized derivative `k = (1-μ)[D_u(β/ν) - (ν/r)|ξ/ν|²(ξ/ν)]`
(L4096–4098), with `D_u = ∂_u + ieA_u` and the a.e. derivative along the incoming section. -/
noncomputable def kIn (e : ℝ) (S : Fields) (u v : ℝ) : ℂ :=
  (1 - S.mu u v) * (deriv (fun u' => S.b u' v) u + I * e * S.A u v * S.b u v -
    S.nu u v / S.r u v * ‖S.xi u v / S.nu u v‖ ^ 2 * (S.xi u v / S.nu u v))

end EmcsfAcExtension
